  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introducing COVID-19 Rapid Tests in Mobile and Conflict Afflicted Population</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With catalytic support made available through FIND&#x2019;s Coronavirus Global Response, IOM will pilot the deployment and conduct operational research contributing to the evidence base for safe and effective usage of antigen-detecting rapid diagnostic tests (Ag-RDTs) in crisis settings such as Northwest Syria and settings affected by large scale population displacements in Iraq, Jordan and Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
